    "task": "question-specific candidate ranking",
    "open_corpus_product_retrieval": false,
    "reason": "Each qid has one ASIN and a preassembled pool of about 10 candidates. The released files do not contain a product-page corpus independent of these pools.",
    "summary_zh": "Baseline 是问题级候选排序：给定一个问题和它自带的约 10 条候选，检索其中的证据再生成答案。这不是产品页开放语料检索。",
    "query_id": "qid",
    "evidence_id": "split:file_line",
    "evidence_id_note": "file_line is the 1-based line number in the official CSV, including the header. qa_pair_id is unique in train and dev and does not overlap across splits, but 150 test rows share qa_pair_id -1, so qa_pair_id is not an evidence ID.",
